## 9.6 Alerting and Incident Response

| Aspek                | Realisasi                                                              | Target NFR       |
| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |
| Alerting             | **Alertmanager** dengan aturan berbasis SLO & anomali.                | NFR-004          |
| Eskalasi             | Rute *on-call* berjenjang; integrasi SIEM untuk *security event*.     | NFR-018          |
| MTTD / MTTR          | Deteksi insiden < 1 jam; respons awal < 4 jam (keamanan).             | NFR-018          |
| Alert kritikal       | *Consumer lag* melampaui ambang, DLQ bertumbuh, failover DB, error rate naik. | NFR-002, NFR-009 |
| Runbook link         | Setiap alert menautkan *runbook* penanganan.                          | §9.9             |

